Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uuhuuhuuhuuhuuhuuuhuuhuhuuhuuhuhuuhuuhn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a tip-off here about a bank\Nrobbery happening in May City?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck with that, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.71,0:00:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let me know if you capture him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hearing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't no ordinary robber!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him! Gasback! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.23,0:00:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta sit back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make that two squads!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send in a platoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.69,0:00:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A struggle over resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, that's all\Nlife is. Kane. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all move things from there\Nto here, from here to there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every person alive is obsessed with their
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own little piece of the\Npie ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the result of hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just happen to have enough\Nresources in your town to pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you don't realize is you took all\Nyou have from other people in places now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.23,0:01:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm criticizing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, life's a\Nstruggle over resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, women, old folks, little\Nbrats, it don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone can dance the dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kane,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think it's\Ntime you did something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about your nasty habit of\Nstealing in these petty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sneaky ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ripping people off all\Nsneaky-like doesn't suit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swindling's also not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.41,0:02:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just never thought people should\Nengage in that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legit businesses are so\Nmuch worse. Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I like seeing the faces\Nof the people I'm stealing from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love their astonished expressions as\Nthey watch me walk off with their goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellas,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where's the struggle if we don't get the\Nbenefit of being face-to-face like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People say once Gasback\Ntears through a bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't leave so much as a single\Nweed standing in his wake. Well that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,depends on how you look at it sir if\Nwe don't resist at least we can walk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of here with our lives come on\Nthere's no need to cry look if this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't gas back at all but that bash\Nthe stampede guy the humanoid typhoon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heck you could forget all about weeds that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lunatic wouldn't leave any of us with even
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.29,0:03:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single hair on our\Nheads. Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh I see you're saying this is better than
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being attacked by that\Nguy we're lucky that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's gas back we're\Nlucky that it's gas back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky that it's gas\Nback we're lucky that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gasback that was the last piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really like the look on those faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ready yet, Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.75,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate to, but we've got to split.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving you here, Gasback.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that wasn't an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shot was a message to let you know\Nthis is the last job we're doing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're fed up with your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is chase down the big\Nscores like some grade-A moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We bust our asses to steal cash,\Nand you dump it into the next job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you were gonna\Ndo this time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that was the whole point, Kane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what a robber lives for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why even bother with this if\Nyou don't take it seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I wanted to work seriously,\NI'd have a real job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pulled these other two airheads\Nover to your way of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we want is to live the good life\Nwhile doing as little work as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as of today, you're no longer our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it just works out that I've been\Ngetting fed up with your petty nature, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you be surprised\Nif I told you the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,police were tipped off\Nabout tonight's job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we're gonna\Ntake all of the cash with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:06:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll blow your corpse to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you can actually\Ntake me down, then give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really thought you\Nwould have noticed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I noticed it's a piece of cake\Nto kill you when you're unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Gasback.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pull that trigger,\Nyou'll be the one to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I don't know what's going on,\Nbut it looks like luck's on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to clear your brains out in one shot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to forgive me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did the worst possible\Nthing you could have done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgraced my robbery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My robbery, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if I blow your brains out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to watch your soul\Ndrain out of your lifeless face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on my donut!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry up and move your foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three second rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three second rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor crumbly donut...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the meanest thing\Nanyone's ever done to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to ruin\Nother people's food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat a pile of smashed up crumbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to live through\Nthis, then sit your butt down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the ones who barfed\Nin here and dragged me into
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this when I was about to eat\Nmy donut in peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tied me up and left me on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head when we tied\Nyou up, or are you always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to replace my donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, if you're going\Nto keep getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a replacement donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand a replacement donut. Give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the Zippanese, a grudge\Nover food is a frightening thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to think about what\NI can steal from you people right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's bash Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep talking nonsense,\Nyou'll be the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dead! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're busy mucking\Nup the works here, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell's your game, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved me first, then you saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do any of us have\Nto do with you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your business here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ain't it better if we all live?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I'm hearing that from\Nthe mouth of the humanoid typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.91,0:09:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving away something for free,\Neven if it's just a single life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's against the way of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but you can't just constantly\Nsteal everything from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.01,0:09:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, once a die's been cast,\Nthere's no going back. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you rolled someone\Nelse's die here today, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't regret what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:09:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a little overkill, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you hit the plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, they got backups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a big problem! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the mastermind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.55,0:11:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clad in a long red coat that\Nflutters in the burning sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's the devil's messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man known to reduce the\Nmost prosperous cities to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An outlaw with 60 billion\Ndouble dollars on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man known horizon to\Nhorizon as the humanoid typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting older hasn't changed him one bit\Nhe kept a low profile for a while but
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now he's got a hundred million double-dollar\Nbounty on his head this morning it's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not 300 million 300 million damn I might\Ngo after him myself I dare you you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just come back in a pine box why you think\Nyou can do it no way wouldn't even try
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the gaudiest\Nthing I've ever seen. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kepler reorganized May City's\Nplant twenty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took him five years to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's proud of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proud enough to build a bronze\Nstatue honoring himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.99,0:12:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, sounds like he's gonna\Nbe a real joy to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a gift for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People love gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, it's\Nbigger than our usual ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ladies, if you're not busy, what say\Nyou join us for an alcoholic beverage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are busy. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:13:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't hurt to spend\Na little time with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a lot to offer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up, what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry about that guy\Nlooks like you started off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a lousy greeting\Ndidn't you what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the town packed with\Nso many bounty hunters anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you haven't\Nseen the posters whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gas back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a rumor circling that he's planning\Nto strike here in Maka City So mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kepler's gathering bounty\Nhunters instead of bodyguards
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why headquarters\Ntold us to come all the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way out here to confirm\Nthe insurance contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The payout for that bronze statue is\Nfive billion double dollars five billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hit the burner deli insurance\Nsociety are on the verge of extinction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your red kid. I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some smoked Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, but you need\Nto wait your turn in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry and give us what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you gonna pay for that meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it smoked Thomas and sausage
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There sure are a lot of bad-mannered\Nidiots riding with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback's just a worthless old thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too old to even know how\Nto rob a place right anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three hundred million double dollars\Nis a hell of an easy payday for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.65,0:15:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't flap your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could turn the tables on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're scared, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be better for your\Nconstitution to hop off the ship right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me see your face for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I found a little birdie in\Nthis dingy place. Traveling alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I found her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say you'd\Ntravel with me, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.61,0:15:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can be one rockin' good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's one fine look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me when I said\Ndon't touch me you're acting like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've never seen a woman before\Nyou guys like virgins or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of spunk in you\Nlady See, I like that in my women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it makes what I had in\Nmind that much more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, because when I force\Nyou to do what I want you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.17,0:16:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whipping out your knife on\Nthis ship is just bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to apologize, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kicked him twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you screw with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick you some more if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not before I shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:17:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your leg's got a bad habit of kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.61,0:17:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, now get her\Nshoulders and pin her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you using a knife earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you might have dropped\Nit over here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, it's just that I could\Nreally go for some of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoked Thomas me but I\Nforgot to bring a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.89,0:17:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you guys\Nwould let me borrow yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've killed more idiots like you\Nthan I can even remember to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one that your friend there\Ndropped earlier when he got saddlebagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I just need it for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to scrape some of this Thomas me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mind do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can't eat my little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, idiot. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready to die! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said get off of me, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just settle down, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.55,0:18:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a moron. Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both, I guess. No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of you are getting away\Nwith this crap, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first thing I'm gonna do is make this\Nchick pay for not letting me touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put you through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cry all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ain't ever gonna let you off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna cry and cry\Nand when the tears dry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you cry some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you to make me angry
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means you're my slave\Nnow redhead you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't make\Nsuch a racket, fellas,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you shouldn't fire\Nyour gun on the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh enough with the applause\Nyou're embarrassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys fired shots, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I understand not firing on\Nthe ship is one of the core rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we gotta follow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rules out here now, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, but we can still\Nbe tolerant of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rules are rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On this ship, we got a zero-tolerance\Npolicy for jackals like you! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your guns and crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put cool and water in there\Ntoo, so you better appreciate that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, here's a souvenir for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe some gypsies or scavengers\Nwill pick you up out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll leave you ladies to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.91,0:21:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This palace screams new money, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, even his guards are\Npretentious and extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Mr Kepler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're busy, so\Nthanks for meeting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.13,0:21:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from an insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but before we get to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know it's not much, but... Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oof! Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.65,0:21:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The package isn't a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:21:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a state of\Nhigh alert around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.49,0:22:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're reviewing the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We decided on the amount\Nafter spending considerable
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to explain the\Ncontents to your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't doubt our report, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was still under construction\Nwhen we assessed its value.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the numbers you gave\Nus before and the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.17,0:22:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you gave us after don't\Nquite seem to match up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands as a symbol of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't put a price on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it sure is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we shouldn't have a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.51,0:22:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By rights, I'd want insurance?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just for the bronze\Nstatue, but for the plant, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in this town, myself\Nincluded, depends on it for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.03,0:22:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of like you\Nsit here earning money
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without ever having to do a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry about this, but\Nit's not possible for the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't cover that whole entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With property insurance, you see,\Nour company just doesn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.85,0:23:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand, but I insist the amount\Nfor the statue remain the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't we have to assess its\Nvalue before we apply it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our company is the stingiest\None in the insurance industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they thought five\Nbillion was appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing we do here now will\Nmake a bit of difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.19,0:23:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't change their minds, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, they didn't send us\Nhere to do the assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.99,0:23:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason we're here is to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to serve as their look-outs so that they\Nwon't have to pay the insurance money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but don't you think it'd\Nbe impossible to steal that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,big ol' thing with so many\Npeople around all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.23,0:23:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not only a matter of\Nit being stolen or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Gasback shows up under these\Ncircumstances, imagine what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.75,0:23:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes five billion!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.29,0:23:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie we absolutely have\Nto protect this that is if
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't want to depend on\Nunemployment insurance Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.97,0:24:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's chat a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.33,0:24:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who and I didn't get a\Nchance to talk on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.59,0:24:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.01,0:24:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.92,0:24:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.97,0:24:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.21,0:24:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you didn't even tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't say thanks for\Nsaving me, then thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, why are you following\Nme like a lost dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.83,0:24:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt our meeting was\Nnothing short of destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.87,0:24:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you didn't feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.25,0:25:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stop pestering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.01,0:25:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it sent the hairs on the\Nback of my neck into a frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.93,0:25:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I know you also felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.99,0:25:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.57,0:25:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the least you can\Ndo is tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.29,0:25:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an allergic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.89,0:25:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happens when I touch idiots like men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.01,0:25:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a good-looking stud like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good-looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear all men are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.57,0:25:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe this was the wrong town\Nfor you to make your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's chock-full of idiot men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.03,0:25:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounty hunters mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go confusing me\Nwith the likes of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.65,0:25:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't inside a sand steamer anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd still really like to know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.31,0:26:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.61,0:26:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.67,0:26:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw something,\Nbut it was an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.35,0:26:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an illusion, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.23,0:26:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.51,0:26:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come out without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.25,0:26:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if he's coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.67,0:26:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.83,0:27:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no chance just making you\Nlose everything would satisfy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.99,0:27:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.90,0:27:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was all that I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.81,0:27:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when I had finally\Nput together a good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.85,0:27:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I next, Armachio?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.01,0:27:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.39,0:27:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And leave everything I've built I have\Nthe power I've wanted my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.77,0:27:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let him take that away
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.03,0:27:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.21,0:27:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, please fire, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.49,0:28:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.45,0:28:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.05,0:28:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay us the rest of the money you owe us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.53,0:28:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we pay in installments?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.57,0:28:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you'd pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.95,0:29:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you, you're one hell\Nof a money gun, my man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta be sheer luck to\Nfind you when I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.03,0:29:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you take my bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.29,0:29:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.35,0:29:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.13,0:29:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to die, there's\Na cemetery close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.99,0:29:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, rape this bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bobs, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.33,0:29:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I didn't take\Nthat big old cross of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.41,0:29:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that was the second\Ntime I gave something for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.49,0:29:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.85,0:29:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve some kind of reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.61,0:29:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to feel you owe me, as\NI got some big jobs planned after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.89,0:29:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll return the favor for you saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.07,0:30:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like I told you at the start, I'm not\Ngonna be part of your robberies at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.17,0:30:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only your bodyguard,\Nnothing more. Yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.43,0:30:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but with that monster\Nof a firearm you carry,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't act all smug like\Nyou've never done a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.07,0:30:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not look like it,\Nbut I'm a man of the cloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.65,0:30:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I am is a part of the\Nlife and death of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.19,0:30:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I fire a gun. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.35,0:30:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of a man of\Nthe club being like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.87,0:30:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going out for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.55,0:30:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us could go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.27,0:30:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.59,0:30:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.81,0:30:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out that swagger!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.11,0:30:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she's\Nlooking back at any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.01,0:30:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you just stop\Nfollowing me? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.23,0:30:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were on the same sand\Nsteamer to the same town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.99,0:30:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to count for something,\Ndestiny, fate, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should cherish things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:31:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then don't you have more in common\Nwith those losers than with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.43,0:31:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only came here to claim the bounty\Non Gasback's head too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.89,0:31:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.87,0:31:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.81,0:31:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.72,0:31:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only came here to meet you, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.71,0:31:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to tell me how you know my name\Nread it off the ends guest register
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.13,0:31:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're staying at the same inn. It's more
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.81,0:31:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like the same One
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.49,0:31:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.09,0:31:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time back off. It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.15,0:31:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm winning this throw already
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.55,0:31:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me? Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.59,0:31:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.07,0:31:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.98,0:31:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm the one who's\Ngonna take it, suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.63,0:31:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.75,0:31:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheaters, I'm quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.13,0:31:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cash first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:31:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Folk over my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.87,0:32:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.49,0:32:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How hard is it to get a\Nquiet table at this joint?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.13,0:32:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.04,0:32:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe two seats at the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one seat. Oh, Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.93,0:32:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got two open seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.47,0:32:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.75,0:32:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple of my friends are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.19,0:32:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they got two available seats!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.69,0:32:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go sit with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.75,0:32:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barkeep, find me a seat, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they got the only open two!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.73,0:32:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.77,0:32:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's quite the coincidence\Nyou're after gas back, too, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.49,0:32:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.95,0:32:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you're considering during this\Ntreacherous time getting life insurance,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.43,0:32:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to let you know\Nwe've got a really simple plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.11,0:33:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.51,0:33:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life insurance just makes for bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.53,0:33:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this chick's a strong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.69,0:33:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.69,0:33:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you come here for the bounty like\Nevery other questionable character?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no i just came out here for the\Nsightseeing is that the honest truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.21,0:33:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah you're not gonna drop yourself\Ninto this gas back business are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.93,0:33:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well don't give me that smirk even\Nif that's not why you're here this
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.81,0:33:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,statue crisis is big time we don't\Nneed the humanoid typhoon running
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.57,0:33:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind just getting out\Nof town and leaving us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.43,0:33:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.34,0:33:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to bail on our reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.85,0:33:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know as well as I do you're\Njust a magnet for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.83,0:33:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to spit the venom, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.63,0:33:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just here for some lame sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.29,0:33:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.79,0:33:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've probably already gotten into\Ntrouble since you've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you had Gasback.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.49,0:33:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just got into town today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.43,0:34:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.41,0:34:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what are you two ladies doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like a lifetime since\Nlast I had the pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.75,0:34:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of your company we had\Na change in immediate
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,priorities Thanks to\Ncompany orders here on
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.59,0:34:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,business lucky you she's\Nas serious as ever. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.39,0:34:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's dependable Meryl go on say\Nwhat you want to say. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.07,0:34:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish you would leave us alone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.01,0:34:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because after this job is over we're gonna\Nhave to get back to following you around
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.91,0:34:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you end up\Ntraipsing off to, next so
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you insurance girls are\Nlike stalkers stalkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.25,0:34:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we just follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.41,0:34:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't kill you or anything
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.91,0:34:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.82,0:34:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.74,0:34:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably just playing dumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.75,0:34:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to stay in town, but\NI won't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.81,0:34:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not cool, not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.23,0:34:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.35,0:34:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.49,0:34:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not being such a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.17,0:34:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash! Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.19,0:35:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not give a flying crap\Nif this town goes into a panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.19,0:35:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, you wouldn't benefit\Nfrom it if it did, so quirk it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.87,0:35:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.31,0:35:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.22,0:35:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.21,0:35:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you treat Vash\Nthe Stampede like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.13,0:35:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know my reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.37,0:35:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.21,0:35:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? That\Nskinny bonehead? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.39,0:35:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd blow away on his stupid boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.89,0:35:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the vengeful monster,\Nnot a chick's boy toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.53,0:35:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he's got something wrong in\Nthat stance, talking about his nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or he's doing cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.59,0:35:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dressed just like the wanted poster!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.23,0:35:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.73,0:35:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.99,0:35:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, you're the real vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.01,0:35:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he looks like him at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.87,0:35:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back after you've worked\Non your impassion! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.75,0:35:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a bonafide hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.33,0:35:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're a bonafide jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.65,0:35:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.56,0:36:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a legendary outlaw\Nwith a bounty on his hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.43,0:36:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:02.78,0:36:06.69,rumbu alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's a limit to how reckless you can be.\NEven Gasback is no match to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.26,0:36:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.89,0:36:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback is no match for Vash.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:06.69,0:36:07.38,rumbu alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But as things stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.91,0:36:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As things stand now, we're screwed.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:07.38,0:36:09.28,rumbu alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.43,0:36:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.77,0:36:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things just standing there, arms\Nwide open, begging for me to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, he ugly-faced\Npiece of junk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.71,0:36:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really gonna waste your\Ntalents trying to steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.07,0:36:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta pay its owner back for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.03,0:36:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took me a while to find the old boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.01,0:36:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I plan to make this robbery\None for the record books.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best one in all the\Ndays I put into thieving.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.81,0:36:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of grabbing fruit\Noff the tree when it's green,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.71,0:36:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should wait it out as long as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.03,0:36:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wait, and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.97,0:36:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, when it's as ripe as it'll ever\Nbe, you grab that sucker and pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.21,0:36:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The action looks the same, but\Nthe taste is completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.51,0:36:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same thing with robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.49,0:37:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reach for your target when\Nit's ripened to its greatest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.63,0:37:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man will experience a despair that he
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.01,0:37:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't have begun to\Nimagine in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.38,0:37:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's almost no point to robbery if\Nit doesn't cause at least a little pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.69,0:37:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's greatest robbery\Nis out there waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.81,0:37:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is exactly where I'm heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.77,0:37:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping you'll come with\Nme on this journey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our contract does say you'll be with\Nme at least until we get to his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.95,0:37:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotten in debt to a\Ntroublesome man, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.19,0:37:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you don't agree\Nmuch, but here you are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climb the hell off my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.65,0:37:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I love the\Natmosphere in this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.65,0:37:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a kind word you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.25,0:37:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one shot from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.89,0:37:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.59,0:37:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said LeBron's statue\Nhas had the troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.21,0:37:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gas back and the insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.37,0:37:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.28,0:37:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, but he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.15,0:37:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaspac is the...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaspac is the...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.11,0:38:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.03,0:38:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.79,0:38:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.63,0:38:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.17,0:38:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that Brian statue is in your troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaspac is the insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say to me, you cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.55,0:38:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll repeat myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.45,0:38:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get women and\Nmoney and stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By forcing yourself on those things,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.91,0:38:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you being sarcastic when\Nyou're calling me a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.31,0:38:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or am I hearing you wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.13,0:38:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're hearing me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.45,0:38:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me clear the whole thing up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.53,0:38:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll whisper in your ear, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.55,0:38:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a shitbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.59,0:38:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.57,0:38:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind taking a\Npiece of this action, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.03,0:39:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Tubby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.29,0:39:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want that chick behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.75,0:39:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is it me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.07,0:39:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or did a fight just\Nbreak out in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.05,0:39:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a marshal!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.09,0:39:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do something? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.37,0:39:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I came here to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.29,0:39:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that cow go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.65,0:39:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a dead woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.33,0:39:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I ask everyone to calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.07,0:39:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.98,0:39:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be a fun place for us\Nall to just relax and have a few drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.31,0:39:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why don't we put our\Nfists up and do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:39:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.37,0:40:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.37,0:40:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bullets, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.67,0:40:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.29,0:40:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give them back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.87,0:40:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, this way,\Nso we'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.94,0:40:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.86,0:40:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two, have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.47,0:40:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be tough being an insurance agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.81,0:41:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you let me off I can walk just\Npocket your pride Amelia can't you tell I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.65,0:41:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not even trying to touch you or anything\NI'm saving that for when we get into bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.27,0:41:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey dummy did you know that\Ngas back was he was almost
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.93,0:41:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caught before he was almost\Ncaptured once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.89,0:41:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something like 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.91,0:41:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.17,0:41:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His robber buddies almost killed him, but\Nthen some stupid moron let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.25,0:41:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good God, it's beyond freaking annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.61,0:41:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always wonder if he'd have died then?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.87,0:41:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how many people could\Nhave lived their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.75,0:41:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without feeling sorrow or pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.73,0:41:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy that let him go was\Nhis accomplice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.09,0:41:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.59,0:42:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that maybe he took\Nsomething precious from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.47,0:42:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My money's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.37,0:42:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stole your first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.03,0:42:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard, you drink my booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.87,0:42:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did a guy like you come to a\Nstinking town like this for anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.31,0:42:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if not to nail gas back?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.23,0:42:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.23,0:42:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like I'm chasing\Nthe die I cast, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.33,0:42:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.47,0:42:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I'll put it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me, we fell into a love paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.93,0:42:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I said to...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.93,0:42:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.37,0:42:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me know if you're gonna puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.11,0:42:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.15,0:42:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you and I should get our\Nlittle tails back to our love nest!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.95,0:42:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.93,0:42:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.43,0:42:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't do it on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.29,0:43:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.93,0:43:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a precious secret, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.21,0:43:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.59,0:43:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind I'll tell you about someday\Nwhen you grow up to be a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.49,0:43:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.09,0:43:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amelia, I'm sorry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.31,0:43:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I won't be able to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.47,0:43:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.75,0:43:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be with you as you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.99,0:43:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That precious secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.53,0:43:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.73,0:43:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.67,0:43:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.79,0:43:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.07,0:43:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.65,0:43:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't meet!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.69,0:44:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, go easy on that drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be able to\Nfunction in our hour of peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.17,0:44:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking, you\Ngood-for-nothing lawman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.09,0:44:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you back to your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.97,0:44:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the goddamn marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.89,0:44:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep patrolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.45,0:44:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things going smoothly, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.05,0:44:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.03,0:44:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a town this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.23,0:44:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say this plant could provide power for\Nat least the next several hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.05,0:44:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.69,0:44:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.27,0:44:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A billion double dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.69,0:45:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.60,0:45:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.61,0:45:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gasback!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.07,0:45:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cannot confirm ID.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.59,0:45:33.60,rumbu,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cannot confirm your ID.\NLeave the premises immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.91,0:45:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave premises immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.45,0:45:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not leave within two\Nminutes, you will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.22,0:45:38.26,rumbu,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you do not leave within two minutes,\Nyou will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.69,0:45:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have weapons,\Nyou will be eliminated.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.26,0:45:42.21,rumbu,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Also, if you have weapons,\Nyou will be eliminated unconditionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.43,0:45:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up, you annoying pieces of junk!
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.86,0:45:43.61,rumbu,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Eliminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.05,0:45:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.57,0:46:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.63,0:46:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a very strange\Nmethod you're using there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.37,0:46:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll fry you like bacon instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.55,0:46:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to break through it,\Nyou need ten lives in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.07,0:46:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.73,0:46:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Machio's factory was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.79,0:46:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's asking you for shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.25,0:46:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.16,0:46:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.43,0:46:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that gas back\Nhit Dennis City last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.49,0:46:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.47,0:47:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.03,0:47:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.13,0:47:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just killed Gasback!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.39,0:47:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I begged you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.39,0:47:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go start my\Nmission to order time!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.83,0:47:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.01,0:47:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.49,0:47:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look pretty good for pounding\Nas much booze as you did last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.55,0:47:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got some good news this\Nmorning which helped considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.19,0:47:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard Gasback attacked a factory\Nin Denna instead of striking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.69,0:47:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.60,0:47:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.52,0:47:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he wasn't even after\Nthis town in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.37,0:47:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.59,0:47:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I thought it was strange for him to\Ngo after such a gaudy piece of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.77,0:47:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being\Na bit mouthy about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.75,0:47:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we have to\Ncontact headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.33,0:47:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.47,0:47:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.11,0:47:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, all that stuff about him\Ntargeting this town was just rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.93,0:47:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.65,0:47:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.05,0:47:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To a different town to get\Nsome information on gas back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.07,0:47:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Targeting this town might have just\Nbeen a rumor he started himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.05,0:48:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be a bad guy, but he's a smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.13,0:48:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to discount that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.43,0:48:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he would have...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.79,0:48:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.19,0:48:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.13,0:48:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'd target\Na remote town like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.89,0:48:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'll catch up again somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.03,0:48:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a crummy actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.53,0:48:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still think Gasback's\Ngonna strike here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.63,0:48:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.17,0:48:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know something I want you to tell\Nme, why are you trying to get rid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.01,0:48:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.77,0:49:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like him...\Ngathering a bunch of small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.49,0:49:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thanks to that, this robbery's\Ngonna turn into quite the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.15,0:49:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.93,0:49:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.67,0:49:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Gasback!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.97,0:49:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.75,0:49:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too early in the\Nmorning for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.71,0:49:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucker's not being able to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.61,0:49:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,300 million double dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.27,0:49:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.29,0:49:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're business!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.35,0:49:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.79,0:49:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my better day! Move it! He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.37,0:49:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback hits the front gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.11,0:49:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.35,0:49:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually here, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.73,0:49:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.64,0:49:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.56,0:49:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only think of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.03,0:49:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll protect that brawn statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.63,0:49:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.54,0:49:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.53,0:50:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.63,0:50:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.47,0:50:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.47,0:50:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.71,0:50:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are going to pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.85,0:50:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I think about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.29,0:50:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.67,0:50:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let him lay one\Nfinger on this bronze statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.37,0:50:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'll be with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.45,0:50:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that? Vash? It's\Nhim! Come out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.77,0:50:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're supposed to guard this gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.29,0:50:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about our contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.31,0:50:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caine!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.71,0:50:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.85,0:51:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it would be better\Nif we just split up all together?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.79,0:51:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.70,0:51:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My assets aren't small like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.35,0:51:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave them behind\Nand run off into the desert
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.37,0:51:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small, do you have any clue how much\Nmoney I invested in that cargo hovercraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.03,0:51:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a fortune Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.79,0:51:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.37,0:51:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is payback for what\Nwe did to him 20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.15,0:51:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.03,0:51:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I've built.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.97,0:51:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.31,0:52:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the one who's been getting\Nin my way a little bit at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.77,0:52:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.68,0:52:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit at a time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.60,0:52:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I tried harder than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.05,0:52:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the roads closed this way
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.85,0:52:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you you're gonna get\Nmixed up in this again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.71,0:52:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't quite get what's\Ngoing on, but here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.57,0:53:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's possible, maybe you wouldn't mind\Njust turning around and leaving town?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.25,0:53:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got business with someone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.27,0:53:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does business mean killing this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.63,0:53:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.37,0:53:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then no, I can't let you go through!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.39,0:53:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to let him pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.45,0:53:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.47,0:53:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needlenoggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.38,0:53:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to\Ngive an inch on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.03,0:53:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At what point did you change\Nyour religion to robbery?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.75,0:53:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.85,0:53:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this out of my\Nobligation to my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.49,0:53:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.40,0:53:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.63,0:53:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.54,0:53:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.95,0:53:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.67,0:53:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.85,0:54:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My contract's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.95,0:54:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.69,0:54:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Gasback, everything\Nthat's happened is their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.73,0:54:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything, even the crap\Nwe pulled 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.29,0:54:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.29,0:54:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I punished them for\Nyou, so just spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.35,0:54:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.71,0:54:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.29,0:54:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.53,0:54:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.17,0:55:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew you were an\Nirredeemable piece of filth,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.97,0:55:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but growing older has just made you worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.93,0:55:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're beyond help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.65,0:55:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.79,0:55:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.95,0:55:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.83,0:55:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.71,0:55:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback! Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.19,0:55:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you. It's over. You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.57,0:55:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of spirit in you, girl
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.61,0:55:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten quiet out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.03,0:55:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.03,0:55:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That it looks like everything\Nworked out for the best?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.43,0:55:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be so\Nblindly optimistic, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.09,0:55:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.31,0:55:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't try it, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.91,0:55:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.27,0:55:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.18,0:55:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That technique of yours\Nisn't going to work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.47,0:56:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.38,0:56:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound pretty confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.39,0:56:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.17,0:56:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should have shot me from\Nbehind without wasting your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.27,0:56:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because now you've left me an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.61,0:56:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.63,0:56:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you give us some time to catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.45,0:56:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.93,0:56:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.43,0:56:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been what, 20 years since\Nwe ran into each other last Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.93,0:56:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.09,0:56:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for a few minutes ago,\Nwow, a stickler for details,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.91,0:56:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're still Farting\Naround like a fool, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.65,0:56:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to tell me how it is you look\Nthe same as You did 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.03,0:56:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm young at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.65,0:56:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gas back is gonna get away\Nto let go of my gun no
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.85,0:56:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way pull your finger out\Nor I'm pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.29,0:57:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.20,0:57:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.25,0:57:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.05,0:57:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.15,0:57:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to save me like\Nyou did 20 years ago in that bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.33,0:57:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man who would think the humanoid\Ntyphoon has a soft spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.37,0:57:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humanoid typhoon don't tell me you're!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.93,0:57:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.75,0:57:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.25,0:57:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Vash, didn't I explain to you, in a\Nworld built on struggles, you don't give!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.27,0:57:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it's smart to give\Nanything not even a single life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.71,0:57:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think the guy you just tossed\Nwill turn out to be a lucky one?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.29,0:57:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know. See ya. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.19,0:57:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.69,0:57:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were\Nthe jerk from 20 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.19,0:58:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.10,0:58:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.83,0:58:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were like that when\NI met you the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you pulled the same\Ncrap again at the bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.21,0:58:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it some kind of religious thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.43,0:58:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.85,0:58:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're all alive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.69,0:58:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why change that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.09,0:58:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.03,0:58:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might think it's cute going around\Nsaving people's lives in your light-hearted,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.47,0:58:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,righteous way,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.43,0:58:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but have you ever thought about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.07,0:58:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you save someone like Gaspak, he\Njust goes out there and kills more people!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.83,0:58:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who wouldn't have had to die,\Nwho wouldn't have had to suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.65,0:58:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People like...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.61,0:58:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people like my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.05,0:58:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill Gasback.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.97,0:58:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.39,0:58:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're being a pain in\Nthe ass as usual, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.21,0:58:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.47,0:59:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my nature to be who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.27,0:59:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who threw the die on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.27,0:59:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you do have the\Nworst throw in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.65,0:59:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving this\Nplace up to that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.35,0:59:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty years of my\Nblood, sweat, and tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.11,0:59:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.95,0:59:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caine!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.43,0:59:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing you wouldn't\Nbe near enough to make
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.55,0:59:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up for what you took\Nfrom me twenty years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.87,0:59:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not even close, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.81,0:59:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make this even.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.45,0:59:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to take everything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.87,0:59:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to show you the greatest\Nrobbery in the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.83,0:59:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane, Marshal?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.69,0:59:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you have us tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.03,0:59:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kane really worked my ass into\Nthe ground these last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.11,0:59:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.15,0:59:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not have been Marshall\Ntoo long, but I had my fun
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.83,1:00:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.17,1:00:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to my plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.89,1:00:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and watch the show.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.63,1:00:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our plans, Dale. Our town.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.93,1:00:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.31,1:00:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.09,1:00:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell? It's rolling!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.59,1:00:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, have any ideas on\Nwhat we should do next?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.49,1:00:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.25,1:00:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've run like the wind!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.81,1:01:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because where there's\Nlife, there's hope, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.29,1:01:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.35,1:01:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not even broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.35,1:01:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The five billion double dollars!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the face, Caine!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the face I wanted to see you make!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.21,1:01:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made a disgrace of my\Nrobbery a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.85,1:01:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and today you're paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.15,1:02:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.05,1:02:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's blow this town!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.57,1:02:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our power plant, we're\Nnever gonna see it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.91,1:02:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really just stole our\Nplants away, so this is why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.79,1:02:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stole the cargo craft!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.73,1:02:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over for this town!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.11,1:03:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle noggin, wait, he won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it or I'll run you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.71,1:03:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you suck!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.83,1:03:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you drive better?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.74,1:03:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I'm a lousy driver!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.17,1:03:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing my best now, Leon!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.37,1:03:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me drive, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.57,1:03:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.67,1:03:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Look out ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.65,1:04:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.53,1:04:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.44,1:04:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you end up breaking the\Nplant, there's no way to fix it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.85,1:04:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Castback escaping's a bigger problem!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.85,1:04:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.17,1:04:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move your ass! Don't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.43,1:05:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.23,1:05:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.83,1:05:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.05,1:05:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the freaking way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.05,1:05:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you screw with me either!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.81,1:05:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.21,1:05:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.79,1:05:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.53,1:05:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.67,1:05:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle-noggin! Needle-noggin!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.51,1:05:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.51,1:06:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Needle-noggin!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.55,1:06:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.29,1:06:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.79,1:06:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.75,1:06:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew he was about to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he have looked so calm about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.63,1:07:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.31,1:07:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like he was\Nthinking, what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.55,1:07:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.61,1:07:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.97,1:07:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's telling me not to kill anyone,\Nbut it's okay for him to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.87,1:07:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing about that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.53,1:07:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mother died because he saved\NGasback. But it wasn't just my mom who
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.71,1:07:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to suffer because of that there\Nare so many people others in the world
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.27,1:07:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who wouldn't have had to go through\Nhell if Vash hadn't saved gas back
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.47,1:07:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he rescues someone from a situation\Nwhen he didn't have to and this is
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.07,1:07:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what he gets?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.98,1:08:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I don't understand this at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.35,1:08:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any point to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.13,1:08:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.71,1:08:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.62,1:08:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.57,1:08:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your fancy words.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.47,1:08:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your ideals.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.17,1:08:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all over the second
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.25,1:08:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.16,1:08:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.08,1:08:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I feel let down. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.31,1:08:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he thought if he tossed\Na die and put up a struggle,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.63,1:08:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a decent point to\Nit all might surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.95,1:08:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like you were saying, once he's\Ndead, he can't cast that die anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.05,1:08:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's the point of the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.35,1:08:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hot out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.99,1:09:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing in town works without the Plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.97,1:09:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our electricity's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.09,1:09:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long is our water going to last?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.61,1:09:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no heater, the old folks\Nat my place are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.51,1:09:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.61,1:09:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we've asked the\Nneighboring town for some help,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.63,1:09:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we're considering renting a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.67,1:09:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, but we're having trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.99,1:09:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you are but water comes first\Nand we can't get water without a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of my kids just had surgery\Nand his breathing machine
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.45,1:09:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stopped working my husband's\Npumping it manually right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.35,1:09:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought he'd go so\Nlow as a steal on Plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.49,1:09:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We keep running like this\Nthe whole town will collapse
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.13,1:09:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop if you end up breaking the\Nplant There's no way to fix it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.65,1:09:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gas-back escaping's a bigger problem!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.77,1:09:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now move!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.09,1:10:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.03,1:10:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not any different from Gasback, am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.11,1:10:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.79,1:11:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.17,1:11:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a precious secret, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.19,1:11:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.73,1:11:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind I'll tell you about someday\Nwhen you grow up to be a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.79,1:11:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amelia, I'm sorry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.23,1:11:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I won't be able to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.15,1:11:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.01,1:11:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be with you as you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.77,1:11:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That precious secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.95,1:11:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.41,1:11:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.31,1:11:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.63,1:11:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.37,1:11:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.87,1:11:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.99,1:12:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a report back to headquarters\Nabout the end of Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.97,1:12:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so move it all redhead
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.65,1:12:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Meryl, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.37,1:12:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're gas backs bodyguard\Naren't you my contract expired
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.89,1:12:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a free agent so you\Nmaybe want to be hired by me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.09,1:12:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're really going to do it,\Nhuh? Why do you share Vash's?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.81,1:12:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,principles give me every bit
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.09,1:12:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of cash you've got as an advance
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.51,1:12:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I want you to throw in breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.07,1:13:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's against all of my\Nprinciples to skip breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.19,1:13:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.49,1:13:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bodyguard fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.95,1:13:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's brought that\Nchick along with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.35,1:13:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cotsie's showing up just the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.69,1:13:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.93,1:14:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.15,1:14:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.69,1:14:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.13,1:14:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock to the left and run\Ntowards where I shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.61,1:14:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.77,1:14:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.15,1:15:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.01,1:15:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.01,1:15:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're missing me on purpose, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.91,1:15:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you came out here to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.59,1:15:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.77,1:15:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to keep this dance swirling?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.73,1:15:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.95,1:15:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant's going back with me. It's what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.23,1:16:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And freeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a world where you take\Nand have things taken,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.55,1:16:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady, you tried to rob a\Nrobber that takes balls!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.57,1:16:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you won't\Nhave much of a problem
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.87,1:16:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with me taking your life away from you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.75,1:16:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you made a disgrace\Nof my robbery, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.69,1:16:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you back, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.13,1:16:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.35,1:17:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.21,1:17:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad. I hate to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.41,1:17:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.95,1:17:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.47,1:17:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going full of blanks or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.19,1:17:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shot him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.10,1:17:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.51,1:17:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.42,1:17:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.03,1:17:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bud, you're doing kind\Nof a sloppy job here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.27,1:17:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what was your plan\Nif my sweet Amelia got hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.57,1:17:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we start with how you're not dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.49,1:18:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought I was a goner\Ntoo, but check this sucker out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.83,1:18:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard Smoke Thomas sure is a hell of a ration\Nto keep on you while you're traveling.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.19,1:18:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the insurance\Ngirls happened to pass by.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.23,1:18:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost died. You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.07,1:18:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take this out of your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.67,1:18:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.91,1:18:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not happy I'm alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.09,1:18:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll beat your ass right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.69,1:18:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound like fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.25,1:18:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I think maybe it's time\Nwe end this whole thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.03,1:18:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if we continue\Non, it'll be a real pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.39,1:18:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.03,1:18:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to settle up with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.27,1:18:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Right here? Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.61,1:18:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this place right\Nafter I finally kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.71,1:18:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out the verdict\Non that die you cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.27,1:19:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.69,1:19:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to jump into this. Always
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.15,1:19:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to steal the spotlight Amelia?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.39,1:19:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ain't a duel. We go\Nwhen this hits the ground!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.23,1:20:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.93,1:20:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.73,1:20:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.27,1:20:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.37,1:21:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.29,1:21:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.35,1:21:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lot stronger than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.85,1:21:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can finally see now that\Nthe legend of the humanoid
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.49,1:22:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,typhoon isn't based solely\Non the devil's luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.27,1:22:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.67,1:22:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.58,1:22:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I owe you an apology\Nfor what I did, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.71,1:22:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.62,1:22:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't saved Gaz back, my\Nmom might have lived a long life.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.59,1:22:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the way things worked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.99,1:22:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.27,1:22:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over. It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.99,1:22:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not over. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.17,1:22:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.17,1:22:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.35,1:22:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.35,1:23:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have one of the gloves.\NWhere did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.49,1:23:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that glove tell me Now that I
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.93,1:23:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made it and gave it to my mom
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.17,1:23:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave it to her, and\Nshe, in turn, gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.53,1:23:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was 20 years ago you\Ngave this thing to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.75,1:23:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.19,1:23:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.10,1:23:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that makes you...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.09,1:23:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you left her behind, my mother\Ngave birth to me without anyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.55,1:23:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her life was a hard one. But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.59,1:23:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave her enough money to live\Ncomfortably for the rest of her days.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.05,1:24:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because someone like you came\Nthrough and took it away!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.71,1:24:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.17,1:24:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one would help Gaspak's\Nwife and daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.95,1:24:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They hated us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.03,1:24:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she die?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.71,1:24:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.87,1:24:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doctor wouldn't even see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.09,1:24:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.37,1:24:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she gave this to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.67,1:24:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never told me the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.97,1:24:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never had time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.01,1:25:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.23,1:25:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how you would have\Nwanted this to end, is it, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.39,1:25:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not shooting a man in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.71,1:25:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this means I cast a die, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.55,1:25:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I can't make fun of you, can I?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.89,1:25:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gasback!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.63,1:25:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you get\Naway with this you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.53,1:25:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't live my life until I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.39,1:26:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deader than dead he's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.39,1:26:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's getting on my nerves?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.09,1:26:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have any idea what he wants!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.43,1:26:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now whoa that designs weird!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.79,1:26:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.97,1:26:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make sure
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.05,1:26:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone dies!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.96,1:26:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe out every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.37,1:26:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,except for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.51,1:26:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Needlenoggin, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.89,1:26:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.73,1:27:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing okay up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.51,1:27:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good, so the next one up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.77,1:27:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't have to give all the\Nmoney to the town, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.21,1:27:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She couldn't pass me off a bonus or\Na contingency fee, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.41,1:27:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.41,1:27:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't put it in the contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.99,1:27:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had rights to have that\Nbounty money, too, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.57,1:27:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you turn it down?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.65,1:27:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because going to the police\Nalways leads to trouble somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.35,1:27:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And trust me, you don't\Nwant to depend on my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.63,1:27:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.97,1:27:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hey, if I'm walking around with part\Nof $60 billion double dollars in my pocket,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot less possibility I'll\Nhave to be an errand boy for a robber.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.53,1:27:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Wolfwood, do you mind\Nnot walking so close to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.29,1:27:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cold sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.27,1:28:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, boys, but\Nwe gotta run on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.69,1:28:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta get our tails back\Nto headquarters ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.95,1:28:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out we don't have to pay the insurance\Nmoney for the bronze statue at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.71,1:28:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.62,1:28:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.75,1:28:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a criminal making the contract out\Nunder a false name, it's null and void now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.71,1:28:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.62,1:28:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can report to headquarters\Nas two proud insurance agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.23,1:28:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so damn cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.21,1:28:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.95,1:28:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can offer you protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.85,1:28:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I can't go with a robber.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.25,1:28:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will accept this, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.45,1:28:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose if I return it, my\Nconnection to you will be cut, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.45,1:28:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, the next time we meet...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.95,1:29:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd meet me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.57,1:29:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, did you have any idea that\NAmelia was only around 19 years old?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.17,1:29:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had my guess that\Nshe was in that age range.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.77,1:29:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm getting at is if you hadn't saved\NGaspak, she never would have been born.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.43,1:29:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the shape of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.71,1:29:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.43,1:29:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must mean you don't always\Nget a bad roll of the dice,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.97,1:29:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even when it turns up snake eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.93,1:29:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.65,1:29:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.07,1:29:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town we're going to just that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.65,1:30:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.39,1:30:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me that paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.03,1:30:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.11,1:30:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.02,1:30:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dodongo Brothers, who were given a\N270-year sentence, busted out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.17,1:30:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.99,1:30:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have something to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.05,1:30:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're not wrapped\Nup with bad guys like them.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.19,1:30:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you or not? Answer me! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.01,1:30:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do with them?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.49,1:30:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you even hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.69,1:30:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!

